WEBVTT

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.740
The time has finally come!

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:20.620
Welcome to the 0048 SC General Elections!

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:30.900
Now let us begin the announcements.

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.550
In tenth place,

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:57.880
75th generation understudy, Kishida Mimori!

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:07.870
Hello, I'm Kishida Mimori.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:16.620
I can't believe I'm standing here right now.

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:21.670
For the longest time, I've been unable to become a successor.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:25.180
I'd be lying if I said I never felt bitter about it.

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:29.800
But I always had a friend by my side.

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:31.110
Mimori...

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:39.800
I'm not good at expressing how I feel,
so I started bottling up all that frustration.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:40.620
But...

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:46.580
I had a friend who protested, cried, and got angry even more than me.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.540
Thanks to her, I made it this far without giving up!

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:53.160
You've got it backwards.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:57.010
If you hadn't been smiling by my side, I'd have been lost.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:00.730
You always encouraged me.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.090
That's how I made it this far.

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:07.020
I may not have become a successor,

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:11.640
but being elected today... makes me so...

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.900
so happy.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:15.830
Mimori!

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:22.750
That said, I still have my promise with that friend!

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:23.790
Kanata!

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.000
The General Elections are just the preliminaries!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.750
Let's both become successors as soon as we can!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.050
Mimori from above, huh?

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.010
I feel kind of ashamed now.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:43.750
Yuuka?

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:48.660
I said we didn't stand a chance, and gave up from the start.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.480
But Mimori-san...

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.440
<i>You never know!</i>

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:58.150
<i>Everyone has an equal opportunity in the General Elections!</i>

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:01.060
She's right. We didn't know.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:04.120
Yeah, that's right. We had no idea.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.340
<i>That's amazing, Mimori-san!</i>

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:11.810
<i>So Chieri must be...</i>

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:18.800
<i>If I'm chosen in the Elections...</i>

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.270
<i>You'll quit 00?</i>

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:22.220
<i>Yes.</i>

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:27.060
<i>If I stay here any longer,
it wouldn't be fair to the others.</i>

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:32.060
<i>Then why wait until now to quit?</i>

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:34.490
<i>You were 9th in the early results.</i>

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:40.350
<i>Each and every one of those votes
represents the wishes of your fans.</i>

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:43.710
<i>You're about to betray them.</i>

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:47.120
<i>I didn't earn those votes!</i>

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:50.520
<i>They're all a result of Zodiac's interference.</i>

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:52.580
<i>Everyone's believing in a lie!</i>

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:57.120
<i>My father earned me those votes.</i>

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:03.430
<i>If you </i>are<i> elected, you'll have
to give a speech on stage.</i>

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:09.280
<i>What you say is up to you.</i>

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.720
<i>I won't try to stop you,</i>

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:15.440
<i>but if you're going to quit,
then tell that to your fans yourself.</i>

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:21.740
<i>If I'm elected, I have to say it.</i>

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.990
<i>Right here...</i>

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.980
Moving on, I will now announce ninth place.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:33.500
- The New General Elections-

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.880
In ninth place...

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.840
Miyazawa Sae the 10th!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.040
Sae!

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:50.260
Everyone, thank you so, so much!

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:52.900
I did it!

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.200
C-Calm down, Megu.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.540
Shoot!

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:06.510
Megumi-san looks overjoyed.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:07.700
Yeah, yeah!

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:11.860
And I even voted for Sonati ten times.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:15.920
Sonata voted for Sonata too!

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.210
Seriously, you two?

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.630
There's no point in members voting for each other!

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:24.090
When will you get that through your heads?

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:24.090
So Sonata voted—

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.020
Come on, work already!

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:41.840
The last thing I want is to miss catching a glimpse of Yuuka.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.480
Is DES interfering with the broadcast?

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:47.410
I'm pretty sure our TV is just a piece of junk.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.300
Dad, hurry up and fix it!

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:53.330
Hurry, hurry!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.870
Right! I've got this!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.870
Here's your order.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:58.860
I'm terribly sorry, Motomiya-san.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:01.730
I know you came here just to watch the broadcast.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:02.630
It's okay.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.340
Thank you for having me as a guest.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:08.470
My husband is still at work,

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:11.300
and I was too nervous to watch it alone.

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:14.150
I know how you feel!

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:17.940
It's a long shot for any of our girls to make it this time, though.

00:06:18.590 --> 00:06:19.600
I know.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:25.100
It's just... she's always preferred cooperation to competition

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:36.330
<i>Everyone looks so tense.</i>

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:39.740
<i>I don't like this. It's scary.</i>

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.680
In eighth place...

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.590
Itano Tomomi the 11th!

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:51.590
Tomochin-san was announced this early?

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.640
She was third in the early rankings!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.220
What the heck?!

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:58.060
Tomochin!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.770
I'm Itano Tomomi the 11th.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.570
Tomochin!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.640
You're kidding me!

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:09.990
This is my first time being a part of the General Elections.

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:16.850
Last time, my sister, Tomochin the 10th, was participating.

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:22.860
All daughters of the Itano
family must audition for 0048.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:31.010
As part of my training, I was
watching in the audience that day.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:33.720
My sister came in eighth.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:39.800
Just like me, her rank had
fallen from the early results.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:44.420
My sister was biting back tears and smiling.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:49.040
But meanwhile, her fans were crying.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:52.910
It was as if they were shedding tears in her stead.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:57.700
For the first time, I envied my sister.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:04.700
I decided that I wanted to join 00 and be loved in the same way.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:10.740
When I look into the audience today, I can see my fans crying for me,

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:13.470
just like my sister's fans did for her.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:20.020
Next time, I hope they'll be tears of happiness, not tears of bitterness.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:27.730
As Itano Tomomi the 11th,
I will work harder than ever!

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:32.780
It's an honor to receive
the same rank as my sister.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.450
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:42.000
Tomochin-san is usually so cool and collected...

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.040
Now she's crying.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:48.420
<i>I'll help you get elected for sure!</i>

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.460
<i>You can count on me!</i>

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.090
<i>I'll do my best to help you in the elections!</i>

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:58.510
<i>The fans give us so much love.</i>

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.260
I'm jealous.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:07.270
If we make it onto that stage,
we can also return our fans' love.

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:08.700
Yeah.

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:12.230
Someday, I want to thank them from that stage!

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.320
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.440
<i>None of us are alone.</i>

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:21.290
<i>Those who love us are helping us toward our goals.</i>

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.660
<i>That's what the General Elections are about!</i>

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:30.040
In seventh place,

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:33.300
Kojima Haruna the 8th!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:41.260
Thank you so much to everyone who voted for me!

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:44.770
Um, Nyan-Nyan hasn't been in an Election for a while,

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:48.650
so I was hoping to just have fun with everyone...

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:54.920
I was surprised by my amazing fifth place early ranking...

00:09:54.920 --> 00:10:01.080
But I feel like seventh is closer to the rank I deserve.

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.490
I'm relieved—

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:08.160
Nyan!

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:09.620
Kojiharu!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.160
Nyan's so disappointed!

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.760
Kojiharu-san?

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.470
<i>Kojiharu-san is usually so cheerful.</i>

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:22.260
<i>I didn't know she could cry like that.</i>

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:25.600
<i>Here, she can admit that she's bitter.</i>

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.600
The General Elections are incredible!

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:32.310
Next year... Next year, I swear.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:35.080
I'll try harder than ever!

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:39.280
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:44.120
<i>I didn't realize the Elections were so...</i>

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:48.740
<i>Thanks to my father, my fanbase grew.</i>

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:53.250
<i>But I couldn't accept that.</i>

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.750
<i>I didn't earn those votes!</i>

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.550
<i>They're all a result of Zodiac's interference.</i>

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:00.090
<i>Everyone's believing in a lie!</i>

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:02.760
<i>I didn't earn them.</i>

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:04.970
<i>It was my father's doing.</i>

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.020
<i>It's too late for second thoughts.</i>

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:18.280
<i>regardless of what led them there,</i>

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:22.990
Chieri, Chieri, Chieri!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:22.990
<i>were all people who liked me...</i>

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:25.870
<i>who loved me.</i>

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:29.290
Moving on, I will now announce sixth place.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.790
Chieri?

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:36.500
What's wrong?

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.130
This is such... such an amazing place.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.840
It's such a wonderful place...

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.560
I can't believe... I'm graduating here...

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:52.770
Graduating? Chieri?

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:52.770
In sixth place...

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:56.230
77th generation understudy,

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:57.980
Sono Chieri!

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:58.440
There it is!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.570
Chieri, go on!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:08.200
Chieri...

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.250
Chieri-chan, are you all right?

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.670
Is Chieri gonna be okay?

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:29.260
In the past, other members have gotten so worked
up at the Elections that they started hyperventilating.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:30.680
But...

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:35.190
I never expected Chieri to become that worked up.

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:53.290
Chieri-chan, can you manage on your own?

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:55.960
Okay. Do your best.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:13:01.880
I... I'm a 77th generation... understudy...

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.840
Sono... Sono Chieri...

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.720
<i>I have to say it.</i>

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.020
<i>It's my responsibility to say it!</i>

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:17.190
Let's see the answer you've found.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:19.730
I'm...

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:22.440
I... I'm...

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:32.700
I want to say... that I...

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:36.250
I... I...

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.460
I love you all!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.260
Chieri!

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:52.720
A-As a member of AKB0048, I hope...

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:58.190
that I can continue to pursue my dreams alongside everyone I love so dearly.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.380
"I-I love you all!"

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:10.460
Wow.

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.320
She was so direct!

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:14.580
This is nothing like how she was at the AKB trial.

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:17.410
Did Chieri turn into a dummy-head?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.540
But I can feel her emotions like they're my own!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.540
Thank you all so much!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.500
Oh?

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:27.970
Chieri.

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:30.930
<i>She looks so radiant...</i>

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.890
<i>and so far away.</i>

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:38.980
I guess Chieri has a sensitive side too.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.310
This was for the best, wasn't it?

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:45.860
In fifth place, Watanabe Mayu MK3!

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.780
Thanks for all the support you've given Mayuyu!

00:14:55.050 --> 00:14:56.700
In fourth place,

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.160
Kashiwagi Yuki the 6th!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:04.380
Ultimate idol, here I come!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.340
I'll make you swoon!

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:15.760
At this point, it's probably safe to say our names won't be called.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:16.720
Yeah.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.020
But it's still amazing.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:20.020
Two understudies were elected.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:23.150
Yeah. It's really amazing.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.480
But...

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.160
<i>That's weird.</i>

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.870
<i>My legs feel cold.</i>

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:38.290
<i>Is the air conditioning on too high?</i>

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:42.040
In third place,

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:45.250
Akimoto Sayaka the 10th!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:48.590
Thank you all so much!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.680
Thank you so, so much!

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.140
<i>I can't hear clearly either.</i>

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:07.310
<i>And I can barely see Chieri...</i>

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:14.530
We're finally down to the last two places!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.160
Here we go! In second place...

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:32.760
with 1,184,848 points,

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:36.300
Takahashi Minami the 5th!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:39.010
Oh...

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.770
Come up on stage, Takamina!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.780
I'm Takahashi Minami the 5th.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:08.580
These Elections have given me the answer to a question I've had.

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:14.260
Those who inherit Takahashi Minami's name become the captain of 00.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.890
I, too, tried my best to encourage my teammates as captain.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.060
But maybe I was wrong.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:24.890
Maybe I was the one being encouraged all along.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:29.400
Today, I competed against my friends.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:30.570
Takamina-san...

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:34.530
But it is thanks to those
friends that I made it this far!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.660
The understudies, who are still budding,

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:43.660
my rivals, who bloom by my
side and vie for the spotlight,

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:47.420
and the fans who watch over us...

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:51.380
All of you are dear friends
who have kept me going!

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:56.840
Please continue to support AKB0048!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:01.760
That was so cool!

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:06.680
You'll always be my guiding star.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.560
Sis-sis, your nose is dripping.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:17.200
It's finally time to announce the winner of the General Elections!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:23.290
First place in the 0048 SC New
Single General Elections goes to...

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:35.340
Ooshima Yuuko the 9th!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.220
Yuuko-san!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:56.530
Yuuko-chan, congratulations on finishing first!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.060
Thank you!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.530
Now let's hear a word for your fans!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:05.370
I'm Ooshima Yuuko the 9th.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.540
First place...

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:12.440
When I realize how much love you've all given me to earn me this rank,

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:15.420
I feel like the happiest person in the galaxy.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:18.010
I wish I could bask in this happiness forever.

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:25.430
Yuuko! Yuuko! Yuuko!

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:31.060
But my true goal lies beyond this happiness.

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:33.400
It's been the same my entire career.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.860
My rival is Acchan,

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.150
Maeda Atsuko-san the 13th!

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:40.990
Yuuko...

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:45.950
Winning the Elections and becoming
center for the next single is not enough!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:51.870
I want to stay center and grow even more radiant,

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:55.540
until I become the fixed star—the Center Nova!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:01.630
I'll be a Center Nova that glows with an even greater radiance than Acchan the 13th!

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:07.850
And even after I become Center Nova, I will not disappear!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.810
Come, follow me!

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:18.980
I'll show you how bright the Center Nova—
the most brilliant guiding star—can glow!

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:26.110
Yuuko-san, that's so cool!

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.530
Right, Nagisa?

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.410
Nagisa?

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.880
Nagisa? You there?

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:38.840
She sure knows how to shake things up.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.000
Tsubasa?

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:45.470
<i>Acchan, please watch over those girls.</i>

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:49.930
The members in the standby seats will now leave.

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:53.440
Please send them off with a round of applause!

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:04.360
<i>I want to stand on that stage.</i>

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.040
<i>No...</i>

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:11.030
<i>I </i>will!

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:26.220
<i>Center Nova... Center Nova...</i>

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:30.550
<i>Center Nova-a-a... Acchan.</i>

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:21.820
Chieri.

00:22:23.170 --> 00:22:24.860
Are you feeling better?

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:26.820
Yeah. Thanks.

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:30.950
Chieri, congratulations on being elected!

00:22:30.950 --> 00:22:32.530
Nagisa...

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:36.950
You know, I think I figured it out.

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:39.920
I know why I was against the General Elections.

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:41.880
It's because I was scared.

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:47.800
All the comparisons and
unavoidable competition...

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:51.800
I was afraid I'd become a spiteful person.

00:22:54.050 --> 00:22:55.260
But...

00:22:55.670 --> 00:23:01.190
when the older members competed and battled, they were far from spiteful.

00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:02.230
They were inspiring.

00:23:03.100 --> 00:23:04.460
So were you, Chieri.

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:07.690
You sparkled. It was amazing.

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:10.700
Nagisa...

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:15.830
But that makes me even more
certain that I can't let it end here.

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:18.750
This is just the beginning.

00:23:18.750 --> 00:23:21.290
Get ready, Chieri.

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:25.090
I won't be easy to beat.

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:31.550
Nagisa.

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:38.880
Acchan...

00:23:45.810 --> 00:23:50.160
The performers will be the elected members!

00:23:50.160 --> 00:23:52.030
Let's make it wild!

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:54.320
I've got nothing to lose!

00:23:54.320 --> 00:23:55.530
Don't give up!

00:23:55.530 --> 00:23:56.920
We haven't completed our mission yet!

00:23:56.920 --> 00:23:59.640
Is that the secret of this place?

00:23:57.540 --> 00:24:00.040
- The Forbidden Star-
